exports[`CLI presentation snapshots > matches setup waiting command output snapshot 1`] = `
"Goal: Configure Groq for this project.
Entry page: https://console.groq.com/keys
Use name: baipiao-project

Steps:
1. Open https://console.groq.com/keys.
2. Create an API key named baipiao-project.
3. Copy only the generated API key.

Safety rules:
- If login, CAPTCHA, email verification, or 2FA is required, pause and ask the user to complete it manually.
- Do not click Billing, Upgrade, Payment, Subscribe, Add payment method, or enable paid features.
- Do not save website login passwords.
- Do not save the Groq website password.

Output only:
GROQ_API_KEY=...
Prompt ready. Copy it into your Agent, then paste the Agent output back here.
Waiting for Agent output. Rerun with: baipiao setup groq --input <KEY=VALUE>"
`;

